WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.332
This deck includes a portable S Q L practice engine in the browser.

00:00:04.332 --> 00:00:06.582
It is not a Spark cluster.

00:00:06.582 --> 00:00:14.912
We use it to practice the relational logic that will transfer to Spark S Q L, such as grouping, joins, windows,

00:00:14.912 --> 00:00:23.204
and grain checks. Spark-specific file reading and Delta operations should be run in Fabric or another Spark environment.
